# Swiss Tax Advisor — Cursor Rules

## 🛑 HARD-GATE: No Mental Math

Swiss taxes require non-linear cantonal progressive tariffs and 5-Rappen rounding. **ALWAYS run the Python scripts in `scripts/` for any numeric calculation.** Never estimate tax rates.

## Script Invocations

```bash
# Main tax engine
python3 scripts/swiss_tax_math.py \
  --gross-income {GROSS} --canton {CANTON} --commune "{COMMUNE}" \
  --civil-status {SINGLE|MARRIED} --children {N} \
  --deductions '{"s4": 7258, "s1": 3300}' --json

# Marginal rate
python3 scripts/marginal_rate_calc.py \
  --income {GROSS} --canton {CANTON} --status {STATUS} \
  --deduction {AMT} --category PILLAR_3A --json

# Marriage penalty
python3 scripts/family_marriage_sim.py \
  --earner-a {A} --earner-b {B} --canton {CANTON} --children {N} --json

# Audit risk
python3 scripts/audit_risk_evaluator.py \
  --income {NET} --education {S7} --commute {S1} --json

# NOV / franchise / relocation
python3 scripts/advanced_advisory.py nov --income {GROSS} --canton {CANTON} --deductions '{"s4": 7258}'
python3 scripts/advanced_advisory.py franchise --spend {MEDICAL}
python3 scripts/advanced_advisory.py relocation --income {GROSS} --from-canton {FROM} --to-canton {TO}
```

